  },
  "description": {
    "fr-FR": "Soixante-dix-neuf courts dialogues entre morts illustres (anciens et modernes), composés pour l’éducation du duc de Bourgogne : l’ambition, la gloire, la flatterie, la vertu vraie et fausse, jugées devant la mort. Édition de Faguet (Nelson, 1917).",
    "en-US": "Seventy-nine short dialogues between famous dead (ancient and modern), composed for the education of the Duke of Burgundy: ambition, glory, flattery, true and false virtue, judged in the face of death. Faguet’s edition (Nelson, 1917).",
    "pt-BR": "Setenta e nove diálogos breves entre mortos ilustres (antigos e modernos), compostos para a educação do duque de Borgonha: a ambição, a glória, a adulação, a virtude verdadeira e a falsa, julgadas diante da morte. Edição de Faguet (Nelson, 1917)."
  },
  "composed": "1690–1696",
  "languages": [
    "fr-FR"
  ],
  "work": "fenelon/dialogues-des-morts",
  "editions": {
