      "edition": "Dialogues des morts, texte établi par Émile Faguet, in De l’éducation des filles. Dialogues des morts, Paris, Nelson, 1917 (Wikisource)",
      "description": "Proofread transcription on fr.wikisource. The edition is the editor’s selection and order; Faguet’s notes, if any, are not kept.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Fénelon died in 1715; the edition is public domain."
    }
